      "name": "Operationalize CISA BOD 26-04 with Tenable One",
      "description": "Key takeaways CISA\u2019s BOD 26-04 supersedes previous guidelines and shifts federal vulnerability management programs away from prioritizing vulnerability remediation based on static severity scores, like CVSS, to a dynamic vulnerability prioritization model driven by real-world threat and asset context. Driven by the rapid acceleration of AI-powered threats and increasingly sophisticated adversary campaigns, BOD 26-04 forces a pivot away from treating all vulnerabilities equally. Instead, BOD 26-04 mandates a dynamic, risk-based vulnerability prioritization model built on real-world asset and threat context.",
